			{
				"name": "behaviorSummary",
				"type": "[ExplorerChange, string | null]",
				"description": "The summary change and its reason: unknown with no rows or with an unknown row, differs when no row is unknown and some differ in bytes, unchanged when every row is unchanged, and changed otherwise. The reason is one of the fixed sentences for unknown and differs, and null for unchanged and changed.",
